usage: analyze_lean_formal_backend.py [-h] --experiment EXPERIMENT
                                      [--preflight]
                                      [--preflight-attempt PREFLIGHT_ATTEMPT]
                                      --out OUT [--previous PREVIOUS]
                                      [--run RUN]

Recompute complete formal verification comparisons from retained raw captures.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --experiment EXPERIMENT
  --preflight
  --preflight-attempt PREFLIGHT_ATTEMPT
  --out OUT
  --previous PREVIOUS   retained whole cells from prior run directories;
                        current terminal wins
  --run RUN             current recovery CPU directory
